<h1>04_语言修辞、言谈表达与信息传播 (Language, Rhetoric & Communication)</h1>
<p style='color:#64748b;margin-bottom:14px;'>本大类共 <b>1955</b> 个高阶抽象概念词（分为 <b>4</b> 个折叠子表）• 支持右上角 <b>🇬🇧 英语 / 🇫🇷 法语（含冠词与阴阳性）</b> 一键切换</p>
<div class="sub-nav"><button class='ctrl-btn' onclick='toggleAllSections(true)'>📂 全部展开</button><button class='ctrl-btn secondary' onclick='toggleAllSections(false)'>📁 全部收起</button><span style='color:#a5b4fc;margin:0 4px;'>|</span><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_0')">01_修辞手法、隐喻讽刺与文体风格 (140)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_1')">02_争辩、反驳、劝说与公共演说 (49)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_2')">03_赞美、谴责、诽谤与言辞表态 (44)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_3')">04_传闻、机密、讯息与符号语义 (1722)</a></div>
<details class='sub-section' id='sub_0' open><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>01_修辞手法、隐喻讽刺与文体风格 (Rhetoric, Metaphor, Irony & Style)</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 140 词 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='20%'>抽象词 (英 / 法切换)</th><th width='13%'>音标 / 发音</th><th width='21%'>中文释义</th><th width='21%'>英文精准定义 (WordNet)</th><th width='5%'>词频</th><th width='20%'>语境例句 & 同义思辨网</th></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>poetry</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la poésie<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 poetry</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'pәuitri/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/pɔezi/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('poetry', 'la poésie')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 诗, 韵文, 诗歌艺术</td><td class='def-en'>literature in metrical form</td><td>4.4</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of poetry (literature in metrical form).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>poesy</span><span class='syn-tag'>verse</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> writing style</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>blues</span><span class='word-fr-box'>le blues<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 blues</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/blu:z/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/bluz/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('blues', 'le blues')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 勃鲁斯乐曲, (非正式)伤感的, 伤心的</td><td class='def-en'>a type of folksong that originated among Black Americans at the beginning of the 20th century; has a melancholy sound from repeated use of blue notes</td><td>4.34</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of blues (a type of folksong that originated among Black Americans at the beginning of the 20th century).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> folk song</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>opera</span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'opéra<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 opera</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'ɒpәrә/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ɔpeʁa/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('opera', 'l\'opéra')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 歌剧</td><td class='def-en'>a drama set to music; consists of singing with orchestral accompaniment and an orchestral overture and interludes</td><td>4.27</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of opera (a drama set to music).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> classical music</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>humor</span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'humeur<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 humor</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'hju:mә/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ymœʁ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('humor', 'l\'humeur')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 幽默, 诙谐, 心情</td><td class='def-en'>a message whose ingenuity or verbal skill or incongruity has the power to evoke laughter</td><td>4.19</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of humor (a message whose ingenuity or verbal skill or incongruity has the power to evoke laughter).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>wit</span><span class='syn-tag'>humour</span><span class='syn-tag'>witticism</span><span class='syn-tag'>wittiness</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> message</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>verse</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la poésie<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 verse</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/vә:s/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/pɔezi/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('verse', 'la poésie')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 诗, 韵文, 诗句</td><td class='def-en'>literature in metrical form</td><td>4.18</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of verse (literature in metrical form).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>poetry</span><span class='syn-tag'>poesy</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> writing style</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>cartoon</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la caricature<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 cartoon</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/kɑ:'tu:n/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/kaʁikatyʁ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('cartoon', 'la caricature')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 卡通画, 漫画</td><td class='def-en'>a humorous or satirical drawing published in a newspaper or magazine</td><td>4.08</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of cartoon (a humorous or satirical drawing published in a newspaper or magazine).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>sketch</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> wit</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>wit</span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'humeur<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 wit</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/wit/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ymœʁ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('wit', 'l\'humeur')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 机智, 智力, 头脑, 理智, 妙语, 机智的人</td><td class='def-en'>a message whose ingenuity or verbal skill or incongruity has the power to evoke laughter</td><td>3.96</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of wit (a message whose ingenuity or verbal skill or incongruity has the power to evoke laughter).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>humor</span><span class='syn-tag'>humour</span><span class='syn-tag'>witticism</span><span class='syn-tag'>wittiness</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> message</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>rhetoric</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la rhétorique<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 rhetoric</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'retәrik/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ʁetɔʁik/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('rhetoric', 'la rhétorique')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 修辞, 修辞学, 雄辩(术)</td><td class='def-en'>using language effectively to please or persuade</td><td>3.95</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of rhetoric (using language effectively to please or persuade).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> expressive style</div></div></td></tr>
